              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-orange-500 mt-0.5 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0zm-7 4a1 1 0 11-2 0 1 1 0 012 0zm-1-9a1 1 0 00-1 1v4a1 1 0 102 0V6a1 1 0 00-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                </svg>
                <span class="text-gray-700">{challenge}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- Step-by-Step Strategy -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Step-by-Step Strategy</h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-6">
        {scenario.strategies.map((strategy, index) => (
          <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start">
              <div class="bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0">
                {index + 1}
              </div>
              <div class="ml-6">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">{strategy}</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">
                  This step is crucial for ensuring your exchange meets all IRS requirements while achieving 
                  your specific investment goals. Work closely with your qualified intermediary and tax 
                  advisors to implement this properly.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-8 bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-6 rounded-lg">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Pro Tip</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Every situation is unique. While these strategies provide a solid framework, it's essential to 
          work with experienced professionals who can tailor the approach to your specific circumstances 
          and ensure compliance with all applicable regulations.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- Case Study Example -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Real-World Example</h2>
      
      <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-8">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Case Study: {scenario.shortTitle} Success</h3>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">The Situation</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              An investor faced with {scenario.description.toLowerCase()} needed to structure their exchange 
              carefully to preserve tax benefits while achieving their investment objectives.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">The Challenge</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              Key challenges included {scenario.challenges.slice(0, 2).join(' and ').toLowerCase()}, requiring 
              expert guidance and careful planning to navigate successfully.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">The Solution</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              By following a structured approach and working with experienced professionals, the investor 
              successfully completed their exchange, deferring significant capital gains taxes while achieving 
              their investment goals.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-green-100 rounded-lg p-4">
            <h4 class="font-semibold text-green-900 mb-2">The Result</h4>
            <p class="text-green-800">
              The investor successfully deferred over $250,000 in capital gains taxes while repositioning 
              their portfolio for long-term growth and achieving their specific investment objectives.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- FAQ Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">
            Is this type of exchange more complex than a standard 1031 exchange?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            {scenario.difficulty === 'Complex' || scenario.difficulty === 'Advanced' ? 
              'Yes, this scenario typically involves additional considerations and may require more extensive planning and coordination. Working with experienced professionals is especially important.' :
              'While it follows the same basic 1031 rules, this scenario does have unique considerations that require careful attention to ensure compliance and maximize benefits.'
            }
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">
            What are the timing requirements for this type of exchange?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            The standard 1031 exchange deadlines apply: 45 days to identify replacement property and 180 days 
            to complete the purchase. However, {scenario.timeframe.toLowerCase()} may involve additional 
            planning considerations that should be addressed well before starting the exchange.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">
            Can I combine this scenario with other exchange strategies?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Yes, many investors combine multiple strategies to achieve their goals. For example, you might 
            {scenario.title.toLowerCase()} while also considering DST investments or other options. Your 
            qualified intermediary can help structure the exchange to accommodate multiple objectives.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-md p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">
            What are the most common mistakes in this scenario?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Common pitfalls include failing to plan for {scenario.challenges[0].toLowerCase()}, not allowing 
            enough time for {scenario.challenges[1].toLowerCase()}, and overlooking important details specific 
            to this type of exchange. Professional guidance helps avoid these costly mistakes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- Related Scenarios -->
  {relatedScenarios.length > 0 && (
    <section class="py-16 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Related Exchange Scenarios</h2>
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          {relatedScenarios.map((related) => (
            <a href={`/scenarios/${related.slug}`} 
               class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow duration-300 group">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-600">
                {related.title}
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4">
                Learn about strategies and considerations for this related exchange scenario.
              </p>
              <span class="text-blue-600 font-semibold group-hover:text-blue-700">
                Learn More →
              </span>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  )}
  
  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-blue-900 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">
        Ready to Navigate Your {scenario.shortTitle} Exchange?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl mb-8 text-blue-100">
        Don't leave your exchange to chance. Our experts specialize in {scenario.description.toLowerCase()} 
        and will guide you through every step to ensure a successful, compliant exchange.
      </p>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mb-8">
        <a href="/contact" 
           class="bg-yellow-400 text-blue-900 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg text-lg font-semibold hover:bg-yellow-300 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105">
          Get Expert Guidance
        </a>
        <a href="/start-my-exchange" 
           class="border-2 border-white text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg text-lg font-semibold hover:bg-white hover:text-blue-900 transition-all duration-300">
          Start Your Exchange
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <p class="text-blue-200">
        Questions about {scenario.title.toLowerCase()}? Call our specialists: 
        <a href={getPhoneLink()} class="text-yellow-400 hover:text-yellow-300 font-semibold">{COMPANY.phone.main}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <!-- Schema Markup -->
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "HowTo",
    "name": scenario.title,
    "description": scenario.description,
    "step": scenario.strategies.map((strategy, index) => ({
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "position": index + 1,
      "name": `Step ${index + 1}`,
      "text": strategy
    })),
    "supply": [{
      "@type": "HowToSupply",
      "name": "Qualified Intermediary"
    }],
    "tool": [{
      "@type": "HowToTool",
      "name": "1031 Exchange Agreement"
    }],
    "totalTime": `P${scenario.timeframe.includes('180') ? '180D' : '365D'}`,
    "estimatedCost": {
      "@type": "MonetaryAmount",
      "currency": "USD",
      "value": "1500-5000"
    }
  }
  </script>
</Layout>